s, y[id(P[j])] += s. y is the SUM over all phrases and positions. Ids 0,1,2 are 0. Rows to the left of the matched window are ignored. The table is data.phrases; do not change strengths.\n  Implement with ops on ctx rows (exact one-hot products) feeding <=40-element cells (spread the phrase-position detectors over many cells grouped by target character).",
